      },
      "message": "Fetch BTC price from mempool.space instead of CoinGecko\n\nConsolidates Bitcoin-related HTTP onto a single host — the rest of the\nwallet already uses mempool.space for addresses, txs, UTXOs, fees, and\nbroadcast — so dropping the CoinGecko dependency removes one external\nservice from the connect-src surface and simplifies CSP / privacy review.\n\nmempool.space's /api/v1/prices returns USD (and several other fiat\ncurrencies) at the same shape we need, so fetchBtcPrice keeps its\n`Promise<number>` signature and every caller continues to read from\nthe same React Query cache key.",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "8644a32ec3ed9879bf83cd351e3de4fa4f8e887d",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/soapbox-pub/ditto/git/trees/8644a32ec3ed9879bf83cd351e3de4fa4f8e887d"
      },
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/soapbox-pub/ditto/git/commits/abc37151ad383c43530180837ccfd63875fff976",
      "comment_count": 0,
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEESof9JJzQIzN3kpf4chHR+ZdE+7cFAmoCpr0ACgkQchHR+ZdE\n+7d56w/+O8fVlTTbLiiFCe48Fj5IGiNzBn4X3LG3TBRRwWAZcnSo2LpOMonhR90k\nHzSD1RNIMcGBim1dwaxc58uuFTmMJOYhliyPAVblfPp7V00KsdoWsdoRs4LeAqpJ\nKm+Bqt3fAxbnW7QeRccRTU4u1eUFBdycvB/+vddP0yZj1mV766e6c0ldSzKUJrB+\noAcwzLOmebwMCjWhVIHh+NzDgqLlWqVYYW0Ft96hTDL8XjkUc8qiV0gr0T9RqQOg\nW91Zaj8E/zmvV2bUtgfCk8tYnIvFYoD7WUtPxNBVCC5aG4ulxGsTTSFq8MnWg77U\n0UJeO2yMpC4+hQ5KR2GAWm9QWf8lvzKjLqQ00BjlG4teiM6+/L2Hyibp2IBSQ14M\n8l0hrdXUTK4W481aeVcfeQqOdsxsEkfEZ2RmdpFYZ8OET2fgxXJtaFjVdi8s2Yqm\nrQP5iG3RjnC9KcLx/AvUoeegN99PQe0Thknuo3SdtPZqbz1dkgy0VHjN5dw/5KvE\nmQAjJlsOWxag8HbqxgbLPZwjzQSRCZmhekvP4mQqEWVWmujLCvJri7aZHYk/kxtc\nDhO1JicAeGtv+R1zTsRaIFMOxOLVKyIE7ocyyDVQ5sW6VLxX8qRbxEMhAl0kgrGW\nhLVZBbq2aqzhPB31jPMGcKdkk6+GsxXd/pEORj3jh1SH+jV4SJc=\n=rmsn\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----",
        "payload": "tree 8644a32ec3ed9879bf83cd351e3de4fa4f8e887d\nparent 814d1909f6ebbde96cd5778bd543a152efcc2a98\nauthor Alex Gleason <alex@alexgleason.me> 1778558653 -0500\ncommitter Alex Gleason <alex@alexgleason.me> 1778558653 -0500\n\nFetch BTC price from mempool.space instead of CoinGecko\n\nConsolidates Bitcoin-related HTTP onto a single host — the rest of the\nwallet already uses mempool.space for addresses, txs, UTXOs, fees, and\nbroadcast — so dropping the CoinGecko dependency removes one external\nservice from the connect-src surface and simplifies CSP / privacy review.\n\nmempool.space's /api/v1/prices returns USD (and several other fiat\ncurrencies) at the same shape we need, so fetchBtcPrice keeps its\n`Promise<number>` signature and every caller continues to read from\nthe same React Query cache key.\n",
